+	 *   keyboard occlude the bottom of it; upstream already bottom-aligns the grid
+	 *   (terminal.css), which is where the prompt and cursor live.
+	 * - The alternate screen has no scrollback and no scroll position at all: the app is the
+	 *   layout engine and redraws on SIGWINCH by design. There is nothing to preserve, and -
